BTW full-feature program for the parser
HAI
  WAZZUP
    I HAS A num ITZ 17
    I HAS A name ITZ "seventeen"
    I HAS A flag ITZ WIN
    I HAS A fnum ITZ 17.0
    I HAS A blank
  BUHBYE

  VISIBLE "Hello"
  GIMMEH blank
  blank R SUM OF num AN 3
  VISIBLE BOTH SAEM num AN 17
  ALL OF WIN AN FAIL AN WIN MKAY
  MAEK num A NUMBAR
  num IS NOW A YARN

  BOTH SAEM num AN 17
  O RLY?
    YA RLY
      VISIBLE "equal"
    NO WAI
      VISIBLE "not equal"
  OIC

  OBTW
    multi-line comment
  TLDR

  WTF?
    OMG 1
      VISIBLE "one"
      GTFO
    OMG 2
      VISIBLE "two"
    OMGWTF
      VISIBLE ""
  OIC

  IM IN YR lp UPPIN YR i TIL BOTH SAEM i AN 5
    VISIBLE i BTW print i
  IM OUTTA YR lp

  I IZ add YR 1 AN YR 2 MKAY
KTHXBYE

HOW IZ I add YR a AN YR b
  FOUND YR SUM OF a AN b
IF U SAY SO
